; A posting to <Account> is deferred: finalize() parks it under its
; transaction's id() instead of adding it to the account.  When a later
; transaction with the same UUID arrives, journal_t::add_xact() releases
; every posting parked under that UUID on the accounts the later
; transaction posts to, including the later transaction's own, and drops
; the later transaction's posting again when it discards the duplicate.
; The Check transaction asserts that the first Paid posting is already in
; Assets:X before the parse ends, which only that release achieves.  Any
; posting still parked at the end of the parse (Other) is applied then.
; Neither the date nor an automated transaction is involved.

2020/01/01 Paid
    ; UUID: abc
    <Assets:X>   $5
    Equity

2020/01/01 Paid
    ; UUID: abc
    <Assets:X>   $5
    Equity

2020/01/03 Check
    Assets:X   $0 = $5
    Equity

2020/02/01 Other
    <Assets:Y>   $7
    Equity

test bal
                 $12  Assets
                  $5    X
                  $7    Y
                $-12  Equity
--------------------
                   0
end test
